
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>     ← max 72 chars, imperative, lower case, no full stop
#
# types : feat fix docs test refactor perf style build ci chore revert
# scopes: gateway auth pricing parcel dispatch merchant notification ai
#         frontend common deploy ci docs
#
# Body (optional): what and why, not how. Wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Footer (optional):
#   Closes #12
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#
# Example:
#   feat(parcel): add status history endpoint
#
#   Customers need to see when each status change happened.
#
#   Closes #12
